# Send SMS through the WhatsApp/SMS MCP Agent
# Requires the app running locally: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
# Runnable directly from the IntelliJ HTTP Client (click the ▶ gutter icon).
# Edit the variables below as needed.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@phone = +491xxxxxxx

### Send an SMS (non-streaming)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Check my trip from Munich to Zadar 12-16.09.2026, for Zadar Shift conference for 4 days, no special preferences  and send itinerary an Viber to {{phone}}."
}

### Check delivery status (paste the messageId returned by a send above)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Check the delivery status of the message with messageId 000000000000000000000."
}
